---
export const prerender = true; // static content only, no Cloudflare bindings needed

import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

const sections = [
  { id: 'about-amsi', heading: 'About Amsi Spaces' },
  { id: 'information-only', heading: 'Information only, not advice' },
  { id: 'referrals', heading: 'Our role as a referral partner' },
  { id: 'no-license-claims', heading: 'No licence claims' },
  { id: 'property-listings', heading: 'Property listings' },
  { id: 'no-yield-figures', heading: 'No yield or return figures' },
  { id: 'using-the-site', heading: 'Using the site' },
  { id: 'ip', heading: 'Intellectual property' },
  { id: 'liability', heading: 'No warranties & limit of liability' },
  { id: 'governing-law', heading: 'Governing law' },
  { id: 'changes', heading: 'Changes' },
  { id: 'contact', heading: 'Contact' },
];
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  lastUpdated="[DATE — pending lawyer review]"
  inShort="Amsi Spaces is a referral and content site, not a broker. Using this site means accepting that we introduce you to partners but never negotiate, represent, or handle funds on your behalf."
  sections={sections}
>
  <h2 id="about-amsi">About Amsi Spaces</h2>
  <p>
    By using amsispaces.com (the "site") you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do
    not use the site. The site is operated by <strong>Amsi Spaces</strong> ("Amsi Spaces", "we",
    "us"), a <strong>referral partner</strong> for property, financing, tools and courses across
    the United Arab Emirates, Cyprus, Oman, Saudi Arabia and Georgia. Contact:
    <a href="mailto:michael@amsispaces.com">michael@amsispaces.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="information-only">Information only, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on the site, including property listings, market updates, guides, calculators and
    comparisons, is general information. It is <strong>not legal, tax, financial or investment
    advice.</strong> Speak to a qualified professional before making decisions. Property values can
    fall as well as rise, and rates, terms and approval decisions for financing are set entirely by
    the financing partner.
  </p>

  <h2 id="referrals">Our role as a referral partner</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Amsi Spaces introduces readers to property projects, financing options, tools, courses and services offered by other companies ("partners"). We do not negotiate price or terms, do not represent a buyer or a seller, and do not act on behalf of any partner in any capacity.</li>
    <li>We never receive, hold or transmit any payment, deposit or commission belonging to you or a partner. Any payment for a property, loan, tool or course is made directly between you and the partner.</li>
    <li>Where a referral results in a completed transaction, the partner involved may pay Amsi Spaces a fee. See our <a href="/disclosure">Affiliate and Referral Partner Disclosure</a> for details.</li>
    <li>Sending an enquiry through this site does not create any agency, broker, lender or advisory relationship between you and Amsi Spaces, and does not make you a client of Amsi Spaces or of any partner.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="no-license-claims">No licence claims</h2>
  <p>Amsi Spaces makes no claim to be a licensed real estate broker, agent, lender or financial adviser in any jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2 id="property-listings">Property listings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Property listings are supplied by our property partners, and details, prices and availability can change or be out of date. Verify everything, including price, payment plan, title, size, fees and condition, directly with the partner before you commit.</li>
    <li>Prices are shown in each market's own currency, as supplied by the partner, and are not converted or estimated by us.</li>
    <li>A listing is an invitation to enquire, not an offer, and not a guarantee of availability.</li>
    <li>Where a government advertising permit number is shown, it is supplied by the property partner. Where none is shown, none is required for that project under local rules.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="no-yield-figures">No yield or return figures</h2>
  <p>
    We never publish yield, return, income or visa-outcome projections for any project or partner,
    on this site or in any advertising. Guides and market updates use third-party sources and
    reflect conditions on the date shown; forecasts and opinions are not guarantees, and figures may
    be revised.
  </p>

  <h2 id="using-the-site">Using the site</h2>
  <p>You agree not to: use the site unlawfully or to send misleading, abusive or spam enquiries; copy, scrape or resell site content or property listings without our written permission; interfere with the site's security or operation; or pretend to be another person, or a representative of Amsi Spaces, a partner, or any partner's brand. You keep ownership of anything you send us; you give us permission to use it to respond to you and to make an introduction to a partner where you ask us to.</p>

  <h2 id="ip">Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The site's design, text, guides and code belong to us or our licensors. Property images, project names, logos and materials belonging to our partners remain their property, and we use them only as permitted by our agreements with them. You may view and share pages for personal, non-commercial use, but you may not reproduce or reuse our content otherwise without written permission.</p>

  <h2 id="liability">No warranties & limit of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided "as is" and "as available." To the fullest extent the law allows, we make
    no promise that it will be error-free or uninterrupted, or that listings, prices or content are
    complete or current, since much of it is supplied by third-party partners. To the fullest
    extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, or for loss arising
    from your reliance on the site, a partner's listing or offer, or decisions you make about
    property or financing. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot legally be limited,
    such as liability for fraud or death or personal injury caused by negligence. [PLACEHOLDER —
    lawyer to confirm exact wording for Tanzanian and relevant partner-market law.]
  </p>

  <h2 id="governing-law">Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of the United Republic of Tanzania, and the courts of
    Tanzania have [exclusive / non-exclusive — pending lawyer confirmation] jurisdiction, except
    where consumer law gives you the right to bring a claim where you live. This is separate from
    the Palmera partnership itself, which is governed by its own agreement.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. Continuing to use the site after an update means you accept the new version.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these Terms: <a href="mailto:michael@amsispaces.com">michael@amsispaces.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
